  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the Scaling Up Nutrition Extended Phase - Bilateral Funding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected impact is increased food security for the most vulnerable households and those most severely affected by the drought, including preventing and reducing undernutrition in children. The expected results are:

-	Real time monitoring of the food security and markets to inform how the household food security situation is evolving with regard to the ongoing drought.
-	Strengthen government of Zambia&apos;s response to improving food security in the most drought affected areas, including through strengthened coordination.  
-	Delivering timely treatment to children at risk of wasting in drought affected areas.</narrative>
  </description>
